# Normalize line endings to LF on commit AND on checkout: .editorconfig
# demands lf, and without eol=lf a Windows checkout converts text files
# to CRLF, which makes `dotnet format --verify-no-changes` fail with
# ENDOFLINE errors on windows-latest while ubuntu-latest stays green.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Screenshots and captures are binary and must never be normalized.
*.png binary
*.gif binary
